(text "The reference divider/filter and comparator power connections are on input1.\nOne fixed logic-compatible threshold for all three channels; no industrial threshold selector." (at 20 243 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "513c51c1-e3e8-51dd-b0b8-6f30aa5492c9"))
(text "0-30 V signal design range; software debounce follows the hardware filter.\nNominal thresholds near 2.0 V rising / 1.65 V falling. Final bounds are in electrical_checks.json.\nNo analog measurement, 1.8 V logic guarantee or CTRE protocol compatibility." (at 15 273 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "5d9e43db-7260-5c02-b188-1a4ac787cf1f"))
